'''Dark Balls''' chase Isaac, flying at a moderate pace and take increased knockback from tears. They're most often encountered when spawned by {{e|Little Horn}}, {{e|Big Horn}}, and {{e|Blister}}s but can be sometimes encountered in some rare rooms in the {{s|Caves}} or {{s|Flooded Caves}} as well as {{s|Mausoleum}} rooms with {{e|Bishop}}s. The Dark Balls Big Horn can spawn are larger and can either behave normally or have different behavior where they travel diagonally, bouncing off walls.
{{clear}}

== Variations ==
=== Purple Ball ===
{{infobox monster
 | dlc         = a+
 | name        = Purple Ball
 | id          = 409
 | variant     = 1
 | environment = Spawned exclusively by {{e|Rag Mega}} and {{e|Cultist}}s
 | behavior    = Floats towards Isaac, doing contact damage.
}}

'''Purple Balls''' behave similarly to regular Dark Balls, but are immune to all damage. 3 of them will always spawn orbiting {{e|Rag Mega}} and detach to chase Isaac as the boss's HP drops. {{E|Cultist}}s spawn a variant of Purple Balls that are indestructible but slowly transform into vulnerable Dark Balls.

Purple Balls can be destroyed by any instant kill effects, such as {{i|Little Horn}} or {{p|Ace of Diamonds}}.
{{clear}}

