 | variant     = 20
 | base hp     = 50
 | environment = Spawned exclusively by {{e|The Visage}}
 | behavior    = Floats in diagonal directions, doing contact damage. Spawned by {{E|The Visage}} and used in its phase 3 attacks.
}}

'''Visage Plasma''' are similar to the Dark Balls summoned by Big Horn and slowly float diagonally around the room bouncing off walls. If {{e|The Visage}}'s mask is deactivated, one will travel towards it to revive the mask. If there are 3 alive at once, they can be absorbed by The Visage's heart to heal it and cause it to perform a special attack.
{{clear}}

