'''Ultra Pestilence Fly Balls''' behave like regular Dark Balls and float towards Isaac, dealing contact damage. Each time it takes enough damage it spawns an {{e|Ultra Pestilence Fly}} and can spawn multiple at once if it takes a large singular amount of damage. Upon death, it leaves behind another Ultra Pestilence Fly.
